[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e09\u5341\u4e8c\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_cher_2",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$chernormal_intro",
        "key": "$chernormal_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Get moving! ...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Don't make a sound!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Nnnh---)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Are they still around?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(They're still here...!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(They seem to searching for something...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(A Reunion member is headed our way! We need to hide!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Must be my imagination.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Can you get a clear shot on him?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(We're too far away...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The explosions stopped as soon as they appeared...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(They're too spread out. There's no way I'd be able to take out all three at once.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Also, their movements are nothing like those ordinary street thugs.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(The other Reunion troops don't seem to be dressed as heavily.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(That's right. As you can see, we must be extremely careful. If any of them survive and call for reinforcements, we'll be in serious danger.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(On top of that, I see one person over there in Caster attire, and they seem to be testing something.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(If they're also able to use Detection Arts...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(They might be able to detect us just based upon a bullet we fire.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(So basically, our hands are tied. Even though it's a three versus three, it feels like we've been surrounded.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Things aren't looking good. I really dislike this kind of feeling.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Though we're supposed to be the hunters, it feels like all we've been cornered into hiding by bigger prey.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Wait, they seem to be communicating with someone...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(I can't hear what they're saying from here. I'm going to get closer.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Don't. It's too risky right now.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(It's too quiet. We don't know what kinds of Infected we're facing yet...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(If any of them have enhanced hearing, we'll be in trouble.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...What are they waiting for?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Something feels... off about this.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Could it be...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Jessica, are you feeling it too...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Y-yeah... I'm also...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The temperature is dropping again...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(So... cold...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Could they be behind this...?!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(...! Jessica, why are you biting your fingers--)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(So that her teeth don't chatter and make noise.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I don't think that's necessary yet, but what a diligent kid.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(To me, you're just a kid too.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(...Hah.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "(As if.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$escape_intro",
        "key": "$escape_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": "",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(...It's warming back up again. Those three Reunion members left as well.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they testing the functionality of something...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "...They appeared without making a sound, only leaving a trail of shivering cold in their wake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "They really are like those 'yetis' from legend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe my guess was right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "They might just be yetis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Found it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here's another wall that's been affected by the ice. But, look at this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a chunk of black Originium lodged in the corner?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "No wonder. The cold wave must have emanated from here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There are distinct patterns on the wall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "This chunk of Originium is the epicenter of all this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "...When I was a mercenary, there was a rumor circulating around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the northwest, the Infected were carrying out guerilla warfare against Ursus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Among them was a towering monster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "As the rumor went, nothing could hold off its advance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shields would be crumpled, weapons would be snapped.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everywhere the monster went, only a barren tundra, devoid of life, would remain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "And within that guerilla force, there was this one squad...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "They were like the chill of winter itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "The land was said to freeze underneath their feet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Buildings would collapse, turned into nothing more than grains of snow drifting across an empty battlefield.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "The trenches where the Ursus soldiers were stationed became their icy grave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you saying that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. I think this is that very legend...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "...the 'Yeti Squadron.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's keep going. I have a feeling that we're going to find the Reunion base soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#4",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#4",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#4",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you smell that as well...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "...the smell of something burning?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    }
]